Changes made in this distribution:
  - Removed the `od:` frontmatter block (host-specific mode/surface/preview
    and daemon-capability metadata) from each SKILL.md.
  - Rewrote host-specific product references to FreeCode.
  - Excluded host-locked skills (custom question-form "atoms", daemon-IPC
    "scenarios", and video-template preview modes) that cannot run outside
    the original host, plus Open Design's own company/pitch skills.

The `name`, `description`, `triggers`, and design guidance in each skill are
retained. See LICENSE for the full Apache-2.0 text and attribution terms.
